<title>SWEDEN: Stena swings to '96 loss of 448 mln Skr.</title>
<headline>Stena swings to '96 loss of 448 mln Skr.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish passenger ferry and shipping group Stena Line presented 1996 earnings on Tuesday.</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Result after fin items	     LOSS 448 vs 201 PROFIT</p>
<p> Turnover				    9,214 vs 9,436</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (crowns)		nil vs 0.75</p>
<p> Operating costs			   8,593 vs 8,276</p>
<p> Restructuring costs			  40 vs    44</p>
<p> Result before depreciation		581 vs 1,116</p>
<p> Depreciation				  638 vs   578</p>
<p> Result after deprec		   LOSS 57 vs   538 PROFIT</p>
<p> Financial income			     28 vs    44</p>
<p> Financial costs			     416 vs   380</p>
<p> Net financial items		CHARGE 391 vs   337 CHARGE</p>
<p> Foreign exchange effects	   CHARGE 3 vs     1 CHARGE</p>
<p> Taxes				  CREDIT 126 vs    43 CHARGE</p>
<p> Net result			     LOSS 322 vs   158 PROFIT</p>
<p> Earnings per share (skr)	   LOSS 5.2 vs     2.6 PROFIT</p>
<p>NOTE -- The company previously forecast a loss after financial items of 450 million crowns.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-7001017</p>
</text>
